.Dd November 6, 2026
.Dt MBT_STATE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_state_open ,
.Nm mbt_state_close ,
.Nm mbt_state_file_ops
.Nd saved torrent list for a session
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/state.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_state_open "struct mbt_state **out" "const char *dir"
.Ft void
.Fn mbt_state_close "struct mbt_state *st"
.Ft const struct mbt_state_ops *
.Fn mbt_state_file_ops void
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A session can save its torrents and add them again at the next start.
Set
.Fa state_ops
and
.Fa state_ctx
in
.Vt struct mbt_session_config .
.Pp
.Fn mbt_state_open
opens or creates a state directory.
.Fn mbt_state_file_ops
returns the operations that use that directory.
Other backends fill in
.Vt struct mbt_state_ops .
.Pp
The saved data is the .torrent file as it was added, or for a magnet its info
dictionary, plus the data directory, the time the torrent was added, and its
trackers and web seeds.
Fallback trackers are not saved, because the caller adds them at each start.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn mbt_state_open
returns 0 on success or a negative errno value on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt_session 3
